// expect: Format.Depth is a target with no color image, so it's a target's only format
// expect: every target has depth beside its color images, which 'target.depth' reads: 'RenderTarget(width, height, Format.Rgba8, Format.Rgba16f)' holds two colors and its depth
// Every target has depth: Format.Depth says it has no color image beside it, so it's said alone
scene Main { }
view Show() { var target = RenderTarget(64, 64, Format.Depth, Format.Rgba8); }
